sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Agent as AI Coding Agent (Skill / User)
    participant API as FastAPI Router (/api/requests/batch)
    participant DB as SQLite WAL (flow_agent.db)
    participant Worker as WorkerController Loop
    participant Ops as OperationService
    participant Prov as FlowProvider
    participant Ext as Chrome Extension (background.js)
    participant FlowTab as flow.google.com (MAIN World)
    participant Reviewer as VideoReviewer Engine

    Agent->>API: 1. POST /api/requests/batch (Atomic Request List)
    API->>DB: 2. Insert PENDING requests (Skip active duplicates)
    API-->>Agent: 3. Return request records
    
    loop Background Worker Poll
        Worker->>DB: 4. list_actionable_requests()
        DB-->>Worker: 5. Return PENDING (Prioritized: Char > Img > Vid > Upscale)
        Worker->>Worker: 6. Check prerequisites (e.g. image exists before video)
        Worker->>Worker: 7. Acquire APIRateLimiter (Concurrency + Cooldown)
        Worker->>DB: 8. update_request(status='PROCESSING')
        Worker->>Ops: 9. _dispatch(req)
        Ops->>Prov: 10. provider.run(job)
        Prov->>Ext: 11. WS send batch_rpc (f.req, CAPTCHA placeholder)
        Ext->>FlowTab: 12. Solve enterprise reCAPTCHA (via hijack_bypass.js)
        Ext->>FlowTab: 13. fetch(/_/AiSandboxAngularFrontend/data/batchexecute, {f.req, at})
        FlowTab-->>Ext: 14. Return chunked wrb.fr payload
        Ext-->>Prov: 15. Return response via WebSocket or POST /api/ext/callback
        Prov-->>Ops: 16. Return media_id & signed URL
        Ops-->>Worker: 17. Return parsed result
        Worker->>DB: 18. update_request(status='COMPLETED', media_id, url)
        Worker->>DB: 19. apply_scene_result() (Update scene video/image status)
    end

    opt Video Review & Auto-Regeneration Loop
        Agent->>Reviewer: 20. POST /api/videos/{vid}/review?mode=light
        Reviewer->>Reviewer: 21. Extract frames (FFmpeg) & build 3x3 contact sheet
        Reviewer->>Reviewer: 22. AI Vision evaluation across 6 weighted dimensions
        alt Overall Score < 7.5
            Reviewer->>DB: 23. Mutate scene video_prompt with stabilization instructions
            Reviewer->>DB: 24. Create REGENERATE_VIDEO request
        end
    end
